grab-start-grabber = You grab your target!
grab-start-victim = You are grabbed!

grab-phase-escalated-grabber = You tighten your grip! (Phase { $phase })
grab-phase-escalated-victim = The grip tightens! (Phase { $phase })

grab-escalate-cooldown = You need to wait before tightening your grip.
grab-max-phase = Your grip is already at maximum strength.

grab-escaped-grabber = Your target broke free from your grip!
grab-escaped-victim = You break free from the grab!
grab-escape-failed = You struggle but cannot break free!
